<p>A smaller space skip from me, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3207203); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3207203&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1593460988" alt="JackalRelated" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3207203)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3207203); return false;">JackalRelated</a></span>. Many thanks to everyone who provided crit!<br />
