<p>Writing music: <a href="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-5420/adagio.mp3" target="_blank">here</a>.</p>
<p>Oh, and yes, it's entirely possible to determine what happened to the Lancer II crew; there's a definite answer that the skip provides. All it takes is close reading, internal cross-referencing, and a little bit of your imagination. Good hunting!<br />
